{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And the princes offered.</b> These are the princes of Israel. And it returns a second time, ויקריבו הנשיאים, because it speaks of the supernal realms. And behold, the first has a final yud, which is a plural form, and the second lacks the final yud, which is a singular form, for the sacrifice is the drawing near of the forces, and it is the perfect unification in which the Holy One, blessed be He, is unified in the supernal realms and in the lower realms."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:30:34.169099745Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}